rofit made is:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "The monthly income of Lucas is ₹42,500. If his income is increased by 18%, then find his new monthly income (in ₹).", "options": [{"text": "47,500", "added": false}, {"text": "43,000", "added": false}, {"text": "48,120", "added": false}, {"text": "50,150", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "increase-decrease", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "If the volume and surface area of a sphere are numerically the same, then its radius is:", "options": [{"text": "3 units", "added": false}, {"text": "4 units", "added": false}, {"text": "1 unit", "added": false}, {"text": "2 units", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "sphere-hemisphere", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "If 125 identical small solid spheres are made out of a big solid sphere of radius 5 cm, what is the surface area (in cm2) of each small sphere?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "conversion-and-melting", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "A man completes his journey in 6 h. He covers half the distance at the speed of 30 km/h and the rest at 50 km/h. The length of the journey (in km) is:", "options": [{"text": "125", "added": false}, {"text": "225", "added": false}, {"text": "252", "added": false}, {"text": "112.5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "average-speed", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "For a sum of Rs.7,500, the rate of interest is 7.5% per annum simple interest. Find the interest earned in 4 years 9 months.", "options": [{"text": "Rs.2,617.875", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.2,871", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.2,671.875", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.2